<ol start="5" data-start="4764" data-end="4903">
<li data-start="4764" data-end="4840">
<p data-start="4767" data-end="4840"><code data-start="4767" data-end="4818">SI n aumenta ⇒ √n aumenta ⇒ 0.28171817·√n + 7 → ∞</code> (crece sin límite).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4841" data-end="4903">
<p data-start="4844" data-end="4903"><code data-start="4844" data-end="4900">Por tanto L(n) − m(n) crece como c·√n (c ≈ 0.28171817)</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
