Existe r_n tal que:
    </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">SI</span></span><span> n ∈ ℕ ⇒ r_n ≡ </span><span><span class="hljs-number">1</span></span><span> (mod </span><span><span class="hljs-number">2</span></span><span>)
    </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">SI</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-number">0</span></span><span> ≤ k ≤ n ⇒ r_n ≡ </span><span><span class="hljs-number">2</span></span><span> (mod F_k)

IMPLICACIÓN DE CONGRUENCIA:
    </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">SI</span></span><span> r_n satisface las congruencias anteriores (por TCR) 
