    </span><span><span class="hljs-type">SI</span></span><span> v(n) </span><span><span class="hljs-operator">⇒</span></span><span> (posible existencia de factores grandes)  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// no garantiza primalidad</span></span><span>
