    </span><span><span class="hljs-type">SI</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-type">V</span></span><span>(n) </span><span><span class="hljs-operator">⇒</span></span><span> se cumple patrón </span><span><span class="hljs-type">P_V</span></span><span> que descarta muchas factorizaciones pequeñ</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">as</span></span><span>
