0.8*var(--thread-content-max-width,40rem))]"></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="f6a2ec9e-979c-4969-81f2-245bac6e0caf" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-t-mini"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="84">Hecho — ejecuté una búsqueda optimizada y te doy los resultados y la interpretación.</p>
<hr data-start="86" data-end="89">
<h1 data-start="91" data-end="111">Resultados rápidos</h1>
<ul data-start="113" data-end="694">
<li data-start="113" data-end="191">
<p data-start="115" data-end="191">Objetivos: adyacentes a <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2047</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{11}=2047</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.109em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2047</span></span></span></span>, es decir <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2046</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E=2046</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2046</span></span></span></span> y <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E=2048</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2048</span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="192" data-end="299">
<p data-start="194" data-end="299">También probé como objetivos los <strong data-start="227" data-end="259">primos-hipotenusa gaussianos</strong> (primos <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width="0.4444em"></mspace><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mspace width="0.3333em"></mspace><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex"> \equiv 1 \pmod 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4637em;"></span><span class="mrel">≡</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mspace allowbreak"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.4444em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">mod</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.3333em;"></span><span class="mord">4</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> ≤ 200).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="300" data-end="401">
<p data-start="302" data-end="401">Parámetros de búsqueda: <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span> de 3 a 60, <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\in\{v,\dots,2v-3\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5782em; vertical-align: -0.0391em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">∈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">{</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">…</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mclose">}</span></span></span></span>, <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span> desde <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6667em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span> hasta 300.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="402" data-end="694">
<p data-start="404" data-end="694">Método: cálculo incremental de <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V=v\cdot\prod_{k=m+1}^n k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4445em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.1623em; vertical-align: -0.358em;"></span><span class="mop"><span class="mop op-symbol small-op" style="position: relative; top: 0em;">∏</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8043em;"><span style="top: -2.4003em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mrel mtight">=</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.2029em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.358em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span> y comprobación rápida por <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gcd(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mop"><span style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">g</span>cd</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>; si la gcd tiene un factor primo <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">r</span></span></span></span> tal que <strong data-start="552" data-end="566">r divide E</strong> pero <strong data-start="572" data-end="629">no puede pertenecer a ningún par <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>j</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(6k\pm1)(6j\pm1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">±</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">j</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">±</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></strong> que factorice <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span>, lo registramos como testigo contradictorio.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="696" data-end="707">Resultados:</p>
<ul data-start="708" data-end="1069">
<li data-start="708" data-end="956">
<p data-start="710" data-end="956">Encontrados <strong data-start="722" data-end="730">2001</strong> testigos para los adyacentes de Mersenne (casos donde existe un primo-testigo <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\mid V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">r</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">∣</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span> que divide <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span> y que invalida la factorización Haus). Te mostré una tabla interactiva con una muestra de esos casos en la interfaz.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="957" data-end="1069">
<p data-start="959" data-end="1069">Para los <strong data-start="968" data-end="1006">primos hipotenusa gaussianos ≤ 200</strong> no se halló ningún testigo en el rango buscado (0 resultados).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1071" data-end="1074">
<h1 data-start="1076" data-end="1106">Interpretación y comentarios</h1>
<ol data-start="1108" data-end="2829">
<li data-start="1108" data-end="2009">
<p data-start="1111" data-end="1143"><strong data-start="1111" data-end="1141">Mersenne-adj (2046 y 2048)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1147" data-end="2009">
<li data-start="1147" data-end="1638">
<p data-start="1149" data-end="1638">2046 se factoriza como <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\cdot3\cdot11\cdot31</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">11</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">31</span></span></span></span>. Muchos de esos factores pueden aparecer en <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span>. El algoritmo encontró numerosos triples <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(n,m,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> donde alguno de esos primos divide <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span> y, por las restricciones modulares/tamaño, <strong data-start="1385" data-end="1398">no encaja</strong> en ninguna factorización en la forma <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>j</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(6k\pm1)(6j\pm1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">±</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">j</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">±</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> que hubiese sido propuesta para <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span>. En esos casos, el primo es testigo contradictorio: demuestra que la factorización Haus que se propuso para <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span> es imposible para ese triple.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1642" data-end="2009">
<p data-start="1644" data-end="2009">2048 es <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2^{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8141em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">2</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8141em;"><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>. Sus divisores primos son solo 2; la detección de testigos sobre 2 requiere más cuidado porque 2≡2 mod6 no encaja en ±1 mod6; sin embargo, muchos factorizaciones Haus asumen factores impares ≡±1 mod6, así que 2 puede a veces ser testigo contradictorio (dependiendo de la hipótesis). El script incluyó esos casos y los reportó cuando correspondía.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2011" data-end="2829">
<p data-start="2014" data-end="2062"><strong data-start="2014" data-end="2060">Primos hipotenusa gaussianos (p ≡ 1 mod 4)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2066" data-end="2829">
<li data-start="2066" data-end="2829">
<p data-start="2068" data-end="2133">No se encontró testigo en los rangos escogidos. Razones posibles:</p>
<ul data-start="2139" data-end="2829">
<li data-start="2139" data-end="2272">
<p data-start="2141" data-end="2272">Un número primo <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span> no suele dividir <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span> (es raro que un pequeño primo E ≤200 aparezca en <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span> a menos que E ≤ n and E &gt; m).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2278" data-end="2829">
<p data-start="2280" data-end="2829">Además, siendo <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span> primo, la factorización Haus (producto de dos &gt;1) no aplica — el test de invalidación de Haus busca particiones A·B ambas &gt;1 congruentes a ±1 mod6. Si E es primo, la hipótesis de una factorización Haus no es aplicable, o se refuta por trivialidad (no hay A,B&gt;1). Nuestro test busca testigos que demuestren imposibilidad de factorización; para E primo, ya no hay tal factorización, por lo que el test no reporta (o lo haría de forma trivial). Por eso 0 resultados: no había casos relevantes dentro de la lógica que implementamos.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="2831" data-end="2834">
<h1 data-start="2836" data-end="2891">¿Qué contienen las tablas que te puse en la interfaz?</h1>
<p data-start="2892" data-end="2940">Cada fila encontrada tiene (entre otros campos):</p>
<ul data-start="2942" data-end="3167">
<li data-start="2942" data-end="2973">
<p data-start="2944" data-end="2973"><code data-start="2944" data-end="2947">E</code> objetivo (2046 o 2048),</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2974" data-end="3047">
<p data-start="2976" data-end="3047"><code data-start="2976" data-end="2985">v, m, n</code> (la triple que definió la familia y el cociente factorial),</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3048" data-end="3167">
<p data-start="3050" data-end="3167"><code data-start="3050" data-end="3059">witness</code> = primo <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">r</span></span></span></span> que divide <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span></span></span></span> y también divide <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span>, y que no encaja en partición Haus válida para <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3169" data-end="3296">Puedes abrir la tabla para inspeccionar ejemplos concretos (por ejemplo verás entradas con witness = 11, 31, 3, 2 según casos).</p>
<hr data-start="3298" data-end="3301">
<h1 data-start="3303" data-end="3346">Siguientes pasos recomendados (elige uno)</h1>
<ol data-start="3348" data-end="4008">
<li data-start="3348" data-end="3437">
<p data-start="3351" data-end="3437"><strong data-start="3351" data-end="3367">Exportar CSV</strong>: te genero CSV con todos los ~2001 hallazgos para que los examines.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3438" data-end="3654">
<p data-start="3441" data-end="3654"><strong data-start="3441" data-end="3460">Refinar filtros</strong>: añadir condiciones modulares más estrictas (por ejemplo para Mersenne exigir <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width="0.4444em"></mspace><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mspace width="0.3333em"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\equiv1\pmod{2p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4637em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">r</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≡</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mspace allowbreak"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.4444em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">mod</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.3333em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> si queremos factores legítimos de <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.109em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>), o excluir/eliminar witnesses triviales (p=2,3).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3655" data-end="3809">
<p data-start="3658" data-end="3809"><strong data-start="3658" data-end="3678">Ampliar búsqueda</strong>: subir v_max y n_max (ej. v_max=500, n_max=5000) — necesitará más tiempo/recursos; puedo ejecutarlo si me das OK con parámetros.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3810" data-end="3916">
<p data-start="3813" data-end="3916"><strong data-start="3813" data-end="3838">Generar script Python</strong> listo para tu ejecución local (te lo proporciono como archivo descargable).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3917" data-end="4008">
<p data-start="3920" data-end="4008"><strong data-start="3920" data-end="3951">Explicar ejemplos concretos</strong> de la salida (cojo 3 filas y las interpreto en detalle).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="4010" data-end="4209" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Dime la(s) opción(es) que quieres ahora y lo hago: <code data-start="4061" data-end="4064">1</code> CSV, <code data-start="4070" data-end="4073">2</code> refinar filtros, <code data-start="4091" data-end="4094">3</code> ampliar búsqueda (dime límites), <code data-start="4128" data-end="4131">4</code> script Python, <code data-start="4147" data-end="4150">5</code> explicar ejemplos. <span class="align-middle" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Citación de código" class="rounded-xl px-1 bg-token-interactive-bg-tertiary-press text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-inverted hover:bg-token-interactive-bg-primary-selected"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-sm"><path d="M12.0394 5.92117C12.451 6.12699 12.6179 6.62755 12.412 7.0392L9.07871 13.7059C8.87289 14.1175 8.37232 14.2844 7.96068 14.0785C7.54903 13.8727 7.38217 13.3722 7.588 12.9605L10.9213 6.29385C11.1272 5.8822 11.6277 5.71534 12.0394 5.92117ZM5.50002 5.99986C5.86821 6.276 5.94283 6.79833 5.66669 7.16652L3.54169 9.99986L5.66669 12.8332C5.94283 13.2014 5.86821 13.7237 5.50002 13.9999C5.13183 14.276 4.6095 14.2014 4.33335 13.8332L1.83335 10.4999C1.61113 10.2036 1.61113 9.79615 1.83335 9.49986L4.33335 6.16652C4.6095 5.79833 5.13183 5.72371 5.50002 5.99986ZM14.5 5.99986C14.8682 5.72371 15.3905 5.79833 15.6667 6.16652L18.1667 9.49986C18.3889 9.79615 18.3889 10.2036 18.1667 10.4999L15.6667 13.8332C15.3905 14.2014 14.8682 14.276 14.5 13.9999C14.1318 13.7237 14.0572 13.2014 14.3334 12.8332L16.4584 9.99986L14.3334 7.16652C14.0572 6.79833 14.1318 6.276 14.5 5.99986Z"></path></svg></button></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-