se" data-turn="assistant"><h6 class="sr-only">ChatGPT dijo:</h6><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="5b127b0a-09e3-44e9-b2ac-8bac16511d24" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="237">Aquí tienes <strong data-start="12" data-end="41">los resultados relevantes</strong> ya extraídos del CSV generado internamente por el script — de hecho, he cargado directamente los <em data-start="139" data-end="151">dataframes</em> y te devuelvo exactamente los elementos importantes, resumidos limpiamente sin ruido:</p>
<hr data-start="239" data-end="242">
<h1 data-start="244" data-end="303">✅ <strong data-start="248" data-end="303">RESULTADOS RELEVANTES DEL CSV (Mersenne-adj y Haus)</strong></h1>
<h2 data-start="305" data-end="350"><strong data-start="308" data-end="350">1. Cantidad total de casos encontrados</strong></h2>
<ul data-start="351" data-end="545">
<li data-start="351" data-end="439">
<p data-start="353" data-end="439"><strong data-start="353" data-end="391">Mersenne-adjacentes (2046 y 2048):</strong><br data-start="391" data-end="394">
<strong data-start="396" data-end="411">2 001 casos</strong> con testigo contradictorio.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="441" data-end="545">
<p data-start="443" data-end="545"><strong data-start="443" data-end="476">Primos hipotenusa gaussianos:</strong><br data-start="476" data-end="479">
<strong data-start="481" data-end="492">0 casos</strong> (porque son primos y no admiten factorización Haus).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="547" data-end="550">
<h2 data-start="552" data-end="597"><strong data-start="555" data-end="597">2. Valores de E que generaron testigos</strong></h2>
<p data-start="598" data-end="653">Para Mersenne-adj, el sistema identificó dos objetivos:</p>
<ul data-start="655" data-end="686">
<li data-start="655" data-end="671">
<p data-start="657" data-end="671"><strong data-start="657" data-end="669">E = 2046</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="672" data-end="686">
<p data-start="674" data-end="686"><strong data-start="674" data-end="686">E = 2048</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="688" data-end="776">No apareció ningún otro objetivo (correcto, porque esos fueron los únicos que buscaste).</p>
<hr data-start="778" data-end="781">
<h2 data-start="783" data-end="848"><strong data-start="786" data-end="846">3. Lista de testigos primos encontrados (sin duplicados)</strong></h2>
<p data-start="849" data-end="936">Estos son <strong data-start="859" data-end="879">todos los primos</strong> que aparecieron como testigos en (n,m,v) para los dos E:</p>
<h3 data-start="938" data-end="972"><strong data-start="942" data-end="972">Witnesses = {2, 3, 11, 31}</strong></h3>
<p data-start="974" data-end="1044">Es decir, únicamente cuatro primos actuaron como <strong data-start="1023" data-end="1043">testigos válidos</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1046" data-end="1085">
<li data-start="1046" data-end="1055">
<p data-start="1048" data-end="1055"><strong data-start="1048" data-end="1053">2</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1056" data-end="1065">
<p data-start="1058" data-end="1065"><strong data-start="1058" data-end="1063">3</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1066" data-end="1076">
<p data-start="1068" data-end="1076"><strong data-start="1068" data-end="1074">11</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1077" data-end="1085">
<p data-start="1079" data-end="1085"><strong data-start="1079" data-end="1085">31</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1087" data-end="1090">
<h2 data-start="1092" data-end="1126"><strong data-start="1095" data-end="1126">4. Interpretación inmediata</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start="1128" data-end="1192">Para <strong data-start="1137" data-end="1167">E = 2046 = 2 × 3 × 11 × 31</strong>, todos sus factores son:</h3>
<ul data-start="1193" data-end="1304">
<li data-start="1193" data-end="1234">
<p data-start="1195" data-end="1234">congruentes con ±1 mod 6 <em data-start="1220" data-end="1227">salvo</em> 2 y 3,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1235" data-end="1304">
<p data-start="1237" data-end="1304">y por construcción no todos pueden encajar en factorizaciones Haus.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1306" data-end="1371">El método-V encontró precisamente <strong data-start="1340" data-end="1362">esos cuatro primos</strong>, porque:</p>
<ul data-start="1373" data-end="1487">
<li data-start="1373" data-end="1391">
<p data-start="1375" data-end="1391"><strong data-start="1375" data-end="1388">dividen V</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1392" data-end="1410">
<p data-start="1394" data-end="1410"><strong data-start="1394" data-end="1407">dividen E</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1411" data-end="1487">
<p data-start="1413" data-end="1487"><strong data-start="1413" data-end="1473">y NO pueden encajar en ninguna factorización Haus válida</strong> del objetivo.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="1489" data-end="1552">Para <strong data-start="1498" data-end="1516">E = 2048 = 2¹¹</strong>, el único primo posible es <strong data-start="1544" data-end="1549">2</strong>,</h3>
<p data-start="1553" data-end="1669">y efectivamente aparece como testigo (porque las factorizaciones Haus requieren factores ≡ ±1 mod 6, o sea impares).</p>
<hr data-start="1671" data-end="1674">
<h2 data-start="1676" data-end="1717"><strong data-start="1679" data-end="1717">5. Conclusión de los datos del CSV</strong></h2>
<p data-start="1719" data-end="1761">Los resultados relevantes son exactamente:</p>
<ul data-start="1763" data-end="2059">
<li data-start="1763" data-end="1843">
<p data-start="1765" data-end="1843"><strong data-start="1765" data-end="1820">Testigos detectados para Mersenne-adj (2046, 2048):</strong><br data-start="1820" data-end="1823">
<strong data-start="1825" data-end="1843">{2, 3, 11, 31}</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1845" data-end="1923">
<p data-start="1847" data-end="1923"><strong data-start="1847" data-end="1909">Número de triples (n,m,v) que producen contradicción Haus:</strong><br data-start="1909" data-end="1912">
<strong data-start="1914" data-end="1923">2 001</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1925" data-end="2059">
<p data-start="1927" data-end="2059"><strong data-start="1927" data-end="1970">Para gaussianos (primos 1 mod 4 ≤ 200):</strong><br data-start="1970" data-end="1973">
<strong data-start="1975" data-end="1998">No existen testigos</strong>, coherente porque son primos y no tienen factorización Haus.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2061" data-end="2064">
<p data-start="2066" data-end="2090">Si quieres, puedo ahora:</p>
<h3 data-start="2092" data-end="2189"><strong data-start="2096" data-end="2102">A)</strong> listarte <strong data-start="2112" data-end="2147">los 20 casos más significativos</strong> (con v pequeño o con witnesses grandes)</h3>
<h3 data-start="2190" data-end="2284"><strong data-start="2194" data-end="2200">B)</strong> filtrar por cada testigo (por ejemplo: dame todos los (n,m,v) donde witness = 31)</h3>
<h3 data-start="2285" data-end="2328"><strong data-start="2289" data-end="2295">C)</strong> extraer patrones entre v, m, n</h3>
<h3 data-start="2329" data-end="2403"><strong data-start="2333" data-end="2339">D)</strong> generar un CSV descargable con solo los resultados relevantes</h3>
<h3 data-start="2404" data-end="2494"><strong data-start="2408" data-end="2414">E)</strong> hacer ahora lo mismo para otro Mersenne <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.109em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> o cualquier otro objetivo <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span></span></span></span></h3>
<p data-start="2496" data-end="2570" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Dime A/B/C/D/E y te lo preparo ya. <span class="align-middle" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Citación de código" class="rounded-xl px-1 bg-token-interactive-bg-tertiary-press text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-inverted hover:bg-token-interactive-bg-primary-selected"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-sm"><path d="M12.0394 5.92117C12.451 6.12699 12.6179 6.62755 12.412 7.0392L9.07871 13.7059C8.87289 14.1175 8.37232 14.2844 7.96068 14.0785C7.54903 13.8727 7.38217 13.3722 7.588 12.9605L10.9213 6.29385C11.1272 5.8822 11.6277 5.71534 12.0394 5.92117ZM5.50002 5.99986C5.86821 6.276 5.94283 6.79833 5.66669 7.16652L3.54169 9.99986L5.66669 12.8332C5.94283 13.2014 5.86821 13.7237 5.50002 13.9999C5.13183 14.276 4.6095 14.2014 4.33335 13.8332L1.83335 10.4999C1.61113 10.2036 1.61113 9.79615 1.83335 9.49986L4.33335 6.16652C4.6095 5.79833 5.13183 5.72371 5.50002 5.99986ZM14.5 5.99986C14.8682 5.72371 15.3905 5.79833 15.6667 6.16652L18.1667 9.49986C18.3889 9.79615 18.3889 10.2036 18.1667 10.4999L15.6667 13.8332C15.3905 14.2014 14.8682 14.276 14.5 13.9999C14.1318 13.7237 14.0572 13.2014 14.3334 12.8332L16.4584 9.99986L14.3334 7.16652C14.0572 6.79833 14.1318 6.276 14.5 5.99986Z"></path></svg></button></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-(--header-height)" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="baa35afc-6bdd-46b8-a793-3c3a03242d0e" data-testid="conversation-turn-35" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="user"><h5 class="sr-only">Dijiste:</h5><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-mar