</li>
<li data-start="7154" data-end="7242">
<p data-start="7156" data-end="7242">El bootstrap incorpora tus incertidumbres <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm\varepsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord">±</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">ε</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> y hace el test robusto.</p>
</li>
