<h3 data-start="1772" data-end="1805">3. <strong data-start="1779" data-end="1805">orden primo del núcleo</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1806" data-end="1892">Si E proviene de una estructura multiplicativa (cuadrados, productos de primos, etc.):</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>mayor&nbsp;factor&nbsp;primo&nbsp;de&nbsp;</mtext><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_6 = \log(\text{mayor factor primo de }E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1076em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">6</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mop">lo<span style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">g</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">mayor&nbsp;factor&nbsp;primo&nbsp;de&nbsp;</span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>
<h3 data-start="1943" data-end="1978">4. <strong data-start="1950" data-end="1978">derivada discreta en log</strong></h3>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_7 = \log(E_{i+1}) - \log(E_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1076em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">7</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mop">lo<span style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">g</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mop">lo<span style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">g</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>
<h3 data-start="2018" data-end="2042">5. <strong data-start="2025" data-end="2042">grado modular</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2043" data-end="2068">(muy útil para cuadrados)</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace="0.22em" rspace="0.22em"><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mtext>por&nbsp;ejemplo&nbsp;</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>12.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_8 = E \bmod k,\quad\text{por ejemplo }k=6,12.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1076em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">8</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.0556em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">mod</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.0556em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">por&nbsp;ejemplo&nbsp;</span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8389em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">12.</span></span></span></span></span>
<h3 data-start="2124" data-end="2155">6. <strong data-start="2131" data-end="2155">simetría estructural</strong></h3>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_9 = \log(E) - \log(q^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1076em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">9</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mop">lo<span style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">g</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.1141em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mop">lo<span style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">g</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">q</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8641em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2188" data-end="2248">donde q es el primo más cercano cuyo cuadrado se acerca a E.</p>
<hr data-start="2250" data-end="2253">
<h1 data-start="2255" data-end="2296">🔵 ¿Qué pasará al aumentar dimensiones?</h1>
<p data-start="2298" data-end="2329">Hay dos escenarios importantes:</p>
<h2 data-start="2331" data-end="2350">🔥 ESCENARIO 1</h2>
<p data-start="2351" data-end="2449"><strong data-start="2351" data-end="2449">Aparece un colapso fuerte en 5–7 dimensiones → hay una MEcuation REAL que conecta los 7 casos.</strong></p>
<p data-start="2451" data-end="2469">Esto significaría:</p>
<ul data-start="2471" data-end="2667">
<li data-start="2471" data-end="2541">
<p data-start="2473" data-end="2541">Los 4 nuevos casos SÍ tienen relación oculta con los 3 originales.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2542" data-end="2615">
<p data-start="2544" data-end="2615">La relación NO estaba en d=3, pero sí aparece en un espacio más rico.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2616" data-end="2667">
<p data-start="2618" data-end="2667">Podrías derivar una MEcuation nueva, más general.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start="2669" data-end="2687">❄ ESCENARIO 2</h2>
<p data-start="2688" data-end="2779"><strong data-start="2688" data-end="2779">No aparece colapso ni aumentando a d=6 → no existe MEcuation para el conjunto completo.</strong></p>
<p data-start="2781" data-end="2797">Lo cual te dice:</p>
<ul data-start="2799" data-end="2995">
<li data-start="2799" data-end="2855">
<p data-start="2801" data-end="2855">El colapso inicial de 3 casos era un fenómeno local;</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2856" data-end="2939">
<p data-start="2858" data-end="2939">La estructura subyacente (cuadrados perfectos) no se extiende a los nuevos E’s;</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2940" data-end="2995">
<p data-start="2942" data-end="2995">Y NO existe ecuación que interconecte todos los logs.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2997" data-end="3041">En ambos casos, la respuesta es concluyente.</p>
<hr data-start="3043" data-end="3046">
<h1 data-start="3048" data-end="3080">🔵 ¿Cuántos datos hacen falta?</h1>
<p data-start="3082" data-end="3113">Para PCA/SVD multi-dimensional:</p>
<ul data-start="3115" data-end="3284">
<li data-start="3115" data-end="3190">
<p data-start="3117" data-end="3190">si tienes <strong data-start="3127" data-end="3146">7 observaciones</strong>, puedes explorar <strong data-start="3164" data-end="3187">hasta 6 dimensiones</strong>;</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3191" data-end="3284">
<p data-start="3193" data-end="3284">si tienes más dimensiones que observaciones, la matriz colapsa trivially (no recomendable).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3286" data-end="3372">Así que <strong data-start="3294" data-end="3300">sí</strong>, con tus 7 observaciones ya puedes trabajar con d ≤ 6 sin añadir más E.</p>
<hr data-start="3374" data-end="3377">
<h1 data-start="3379" data-end="3399">✔ CONCLUSIÓN CLARA</h1>
<p data-start="3401" data-end="3581"><strong data-start="3401" data-end="3466">YA tienes suficientes datos para aumentar la dimensionalidad.</strong><br data-start="3466" data-end="3469">
No necesitas añadir más observaciones.<br data-start="3507" data-end="3510">
Sólo necesitas añadir <strong data-start="3532" data-end="3551">nuevas features</strong> y repetir el test de colapso.</p>
<hr data-start="3583" data-end="3586">
