<p data-start="876" data-end="1031">es decir <strong data-start="885" data-end="908">todos los cuadrados</strong> generan vectores colineales entre sí (1-dimensional) — eso es la MEcuation efectiva que detectamos para <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>25</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>49</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>121</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{25,49,121\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">{</span><span class="mord">25</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">49</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">121</span><span class="mclose">}</span></span></span></span>.</p>
<p data-start="1033" data-end="1299"><strong data-start="1033" data-end="1062">Enunciado (versión útil).</strong><br data-start="1062" data-end="1065">
