</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3361" data-end="3387">→ mercado <strong data-start="3371" data-end="3386">trillonario</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="3389" data-end="3392">
<h1 data-start="3394" data-end="3424">⭐ <strong data-start="3398" data-end="3422">4. Primos Gaussianos</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="3425" data-end="3450">Uso indirecto enorme:</h3>
<ul data-start="3451" data-end="3607">
<li data-start="3451" data-end="3476">
<p data-start="3453" data-end="3476">criptografía elíptica</p>
