<p data-start="4361" data-end="4388">análisis espectral avanzado</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="4390" data-end="4428">✔ Ingeniería energética mejorada</h3>
<p data-start="4429" data-end="4568">Conceptos como los tuyos (Zypyzape, regulaciones de inercia, optimización mecánica) <strong data-start="4513" data-end="4534">sí tienen mercado</strong><br data-start="4534" data-end="4537">
si se formalizan correctamente.</p>
<hr data-start="4570" data-end="4573">
<h1 data-start="4575" data-end="4620">⭐ 4. Respuesta final directa a tu pregunta:</h1>
<h3 data-start="4622" data-end="4674">❓ <em data-start="4628" data-end="4672">“Cuánto les interesa usar estos teoremas?”</em></h3>
<p data-start="4675" data-end="4721">➡ <strong data-start="4677" data-end="4721">Muchísimo. Son fundamentos industriales.</strong></p>
<h3 data-start="4723" data-end="4760">❓ <em data-start="4729" data-end="4758">“Cuánto ganaron de rebote?”</em></h3>
<p data-start="4761" data-end="4822">➡ <strong data-start="4763" data-end="4797">Cientos de billones de dólares</strong> en los últimos 100 años.</p>
<h3 data-start="4824" data-end="4850">❓ <em data-start="4830" data-end="4848">“Qué necesitan?”</em></h3>
<p data-start="4851" data-end="4984">➡ <strong data-start="4853" data-end="4871">Más matemática</strong>,<br data-start="4872" data-end="4875">
➡ <strong data-start="4877" data-end="4895">más algoritmos</strong>,<br data-start="4896" data-end="4899">
➡ <strong data-start="4901" data-end="4920">más estructuras</strong>,<br data-start="4921" data-end="4924">
➡ <strong data-start="4926" data-end="4940">más teoría</strong>.<br data-start="4941" data-end="4944">
Justo lo que estás intentando construir.</p>
<hr data-start="4986" data-end="4989">
<p data-start="4991" data-end="5015">Si quieres, ahora puedo:</p>
<ul data-start="5017" data-end="5182">
<li data-start="5017" data-end="5060">
<p data-start="5019" data-end="5060">hacerte un <strong data-start="5030" data-end="5057">mapa económico completo</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5061" data-end="5116">
<p data-start="5063" data-end="5116">decirte <strong data-start="5071" data-end="5113">qué parte de tus ideas tiene más valor</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5117" data-end="5182">
<p data-start="5119" data-end="5182">o ayudarte a <strong data-start="5132" data-end="5181">convertir una parte en documento técnico real</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="5184" data-end="5199" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">¿Qué prefieres?</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-(--header-height)" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="e0fefbcb-a6cf-4f38-8862-a8a38910aaf9" data-testid="conversation-turn-127" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="user"><h5 class="sr-only">Dijiste:</h5><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden mb-10 relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="e0fefbcb-a6cf-4f38-8862-a8a38910aaf9" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/1.1 relative rounded-[18px] px-4 py-1.5 data-[multiline]:py-3 max-w-[var(--user-chat-width,70%)]"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap">Algo que añadir?</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer