w.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></span></span></button></div></div><div class="max-w-[calc(0.8*var(--thread-content-max-width,40rem))]"></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="e2ac4185-7f91-494f-b799-03e45f27d520" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-t-mini"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="475">Genial — me encanta la idea. Voy a darte <strong data-start="41" data-end="74">un plan completo y accionable</strong> para <strong data-start="80" data-end="91">simular</strong> la noria (eje que se acelera) con <strong data-start="126" data-end="143">100 Teslabots</strong> (robots que actúan sobre la estructura), <strong data-start="185" data-end="202">energía solar</strong> y un <strong data-start="208" data-end="244">circuito con desfase/sincronismo</strong>. No te voy a pedir nada más: hago suposiciones razonables y te doy modelos, EDOs, arquitectura de control, experimentos a correr y métricas para evaluar. Si quieres, después te doy código (Python/Modelica/Simulink) basado en esto.</p>
<hr data-start="477" data-end="480">
<h2 data-start="482" data-end="527">1) Resumen del sistema que vamos a modelar</h2>
<ul data-start="528" data-end="1459">
<li data-start="528" data-end="650">
<p data-start="530" data-end="650"><strong data-start="530" data-end="553">Mecánica rotacional</strong>: una noria (disco rígido) de inercia <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">I</span></span></span></span> y radio <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span></span></span></span>. Eje rotatorio con fricción <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7167em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1132em;">τ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1132em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="651" data-end="837">
<p data-start="653" data-end="837"><strong data-start="653" data-end="668">Carga móvil</strong>: 100 Teslabots situados en el perímetro; cada bot puede aplicar un par motriz local <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_i(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> (empujar/pisar/actuar) y desplazarse (variación de momento) si se quiere.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="838" data-end="988">
<p data-start="840" data-end="988"><strong data-start="840" data-end="864">Actuadores centrales</strong>: motor/generador en el eje con torque <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_m(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> controlado por inverter. Puede entregar o absorber energía (regeneración).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="989" data-end="1129">
<p data-start="991" data-end="1129"><strong data-start="991" data-end="1011">Fuente eléctrica</strong>: paneles solares con MPPT, batería/BD (almacenamiento), inversor trifásico que alimenta el motor. Red local opcional.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1130" data-end="1361">
<p data-start="1132" data-end="1361"><strong data-start="1132" data-end="1167">Circuito con desfase sincrónico</strong>: modelaremos un inversor trifásico con control de fase (vector control / PLL) que introduce un desfase deseado entre la referencia y la tensión (para controlar potencia reactiva o sincronismo).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1362" data-end="1459">
<p data-start="1364" data-end="1459"><strong data-start="1364" data-end="1376">Ambiente</strong>: rozamiento aerodinámico <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{aero}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">a</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">ero</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, cargas aleatorias en bots, fallos posibles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1461" data-end="1754">Objetivo de la simulación: <strong data-start="1488" data-end="1515">ver la dinámica angular</strong> <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> y aceleración <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> del eje ante la acción combinada de bots y la alimentación solar, optimizando control (sincronismo, MPPT, almacenamiento) y comprobando estabilidad y límites (velocidad máxima, picos de potencia).</p>
<hr data-start="1756" data-end="1759">
<h2 data-start="1761" data-end="1802">2) Modelo físico esencial (ecuaciones)</h2>
<h3 data-start="1804" data-end="1838">2.1 Ecuación rotacional global</h3>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mtext> </mtext><mover accent="true"><mi>ω</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></munderover><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I \,\dot{\omega}(t) = T_m(t) + \sum_{i=1}^{100} T_i(t) - T_f(\omega) - T_{aero}(\omega) - T_{grav}(\theta(t))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">I</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6679em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.1389em;"><span class="mord">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><spa