<p data-start="3352" data-end="3391">y <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{inv} \approx P_m + P_{losses}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">in</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.01968em;">l</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">osses</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
<h3 data-start="3393" data-end="3429">2.5 Control sincrónico / desfase</h3>
<p data-start="3430" data-end="3771">Modela el inversor trifásico con control por orientación de vector (dq). Una referencia de tensión/frecuencia <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V_{ref}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.2222em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">re</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> sincronizada por PLL; introduces un desfase <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{shift}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9805em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">ϕ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">s</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">hi</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (controlable) para alterar la potencia reactiva o sincronizar la fase con otras fuentes. Esto afecta la inyección de potencia y torque producido por el motor.</p>
<hr data-start="3773" data-end="3776">
<h2 data-start="3778" data-end="3829">3) Componentes del modelo y niveles de fidelidad</h2>
<ul data-start="3831" data-end="4334">
<li data-start="3831" data-end="3998">
<p data-start="3833" data-end="3998"><strong data-start="3833" data-end="3859">Nivel 0 (simplificado)</strong>: rotación 1-DOF, torque agregado de bots (sumado), motor como fuente torque saturada, PV como señal de potencia. Útil para estudio rápido.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3999" data-end="4128">
<p data-start="4001" data-end="4128"><strong data-start="4001" data-end="4025">Nivel 1 (intermedio)</strong>: añade dinámica de inverter (PLL, control dq), MPPT y batería con pérdidas, aerodinámica simplificada.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4129" data-end="4334">
<p data-start="4131" data-end="4334"><strong data-start="4131" data-end="4154">Nivel 2 (detallado)</strong>: modelado por bot individual (100 agentes), movimiento radial/azimutal, interacción estructural, modelado térmico de paneles, control de bajo nivel de motores de cada bot, fallas.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4336" data-end="4373">Empieza en Nivel 0 o 1, luego escala.</p>
<hr data-start="4375" data-end="4378">
<h2 data-start="4380" data-end="4418">4) Arquitectura de control sugerida</h2>
<ol data-start="4420" data-end="5130">
<li data-start="4420" data-end="4581">
<p data-start="4423" data-end="4581"><strong data-start="4423" data-end="4459">Supervisory Energy Manager (SEM)</strong>: decide cuánto motor puede consumir/recuperar según <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{pv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, SoC, demanda y política (priorizar SoC mínimo/seguridad).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4582" data-end="4667">
<p data-start="4585" data-end="4667"><strong data-start="4585" data-end="4605">Speed controller</strong>: PI/PID para <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span></span></span></span> (setpoint) generando <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{m_{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0364em; vertical-align: -0.3531em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3448em;"><span style="top: -2.3488em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.0714em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.5em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">re</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2901em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3531em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4668" data-end="4845">
<p data-start="4671" data-end="4845"><strong data-start="4671" data-end="4691">Torque allocator</strong>: reparte esfuerzo entre motor central y Teslabots <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (si trabajan cooperativamente). Ejemplo: prioridad motor central; bots solo cuando PV no cubre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4846" data-end="4963">
<p data-start="4849" data-end="4963"><strong data-start="4849" data-end="4882">Inverter vector control + PLL</strong>: mantiene la fase, introduce <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{shift}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9805em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">ϕ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">s</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">hi</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> si se necesita desfase sincrónico.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4964" data-end="5014">
<p data-start="4967" data-end="5014"><strong data-start="4967" data-end="4975">MPPT</strong>: controla punto de trabajo de paneles.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5015" data-end="5130">
<p data-start="5018" data-end="5130"><strong data-start="5018" data-end="5042">Bot local controller</strong>: cada Teslabot decide empujar/frenar según sincronismo con SEM (algoritmo distribuido).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="5132" data-end="5135">
<h2 data-start="5137" data-end="5190">5) Experimentos de simulación recomendados (suite)</h2>
<p data-start="5192" data-end="5250">Para cada experimento ejecuta varias semillas/variaciones.</p>
<h3 data-start="5252" data-end="5270">E1 — Caso base</h3>
<ul data-start="5271" data-end="5419">
<li data-start="5271" data-end="5419">
<p data-start="5273" data-end="5419">Nivel 0: todos bots con <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_i=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>, motor con <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{pv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> variable (nublado/soleado). Objetivo: máxima velocidad alcanzable, perfiles <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="5421" data-end="5453">E2 — Teslabots colaborativos</h3>
<ul data-start="5454" data-end="5571">
<li data-start="5454" data-end="5571">
<p data-start="5456" data-end="5571">Bots aplican par síncrono con fase (pulsos periódicos). Evalúa reducción de necesidad de motor y picos de potencia.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="5573" data-end="5619">E3 — Aceleración del eje (arranque rápido)</h3>
<ul data-start="5620" data-end="5745">
<li data-start="5620" data-end="5745">
<p data-start="5622" data-end="5745">Deseo: aumentar <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span></span></span></span> desde 0 a <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7167em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">a</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">r</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">g</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> en <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{ramp}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">r</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">am</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>. Ver consumo PV + batería y limitaciones térmicas.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="5747" data-end="5774">E4 — Desfase sincrónico</h3>
<ul data-start="5775" data-end="5935">
<li data-start="5775" data-end="5935">
<p data-start="5777" data-end="5935">Introduce <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{shift}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9805em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">ϕ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">s</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">hi</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.10764em;">f</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> en el inversor y observa efecto en <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> y estabilidad (resonancias). Mide capacidad de controlar potencia reactiva y eficiencia.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="5937" data-end="5963">E5 — Fallos y robustez</h3>
<ul data-start="5964" data-end="6093">
<li data-start="5964" data-end="6093">
<p data-start="5966" data-end="6093">Quitar paneles (sombra), 10 bots fallan, o batería desconecta. Observa respuesta de control y riesgo de sobrevelocidad o caída.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="6095" data-end="6127">E6 — Optimización energética</h3>
<ul data-start="6128" data-end="6238">
<li data-start="6128" data-end="6238">
<p data-start="6130" data-end="6238">Juega con políticas: priorizar uso de bots vs motor central; política que minimiza pérdida total de energía.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="6240" data-end="6243">
<h2 data-start="6245" data-end="6270">6) Métricas a reportar</h2>
<ul data-start="6271" data-end="6697">
<li data-start="6271" data-end="6338">
<p data-start="6273" data-end="6338"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> y <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> (máximo, RMS, overshoot, settling).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6339" data-end="6414">
<p data-start="6341" data-end="6414">Energía consumida por motor <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">m</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> y energía aportada por PV <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{pv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6415" data-end="6452">
<p data-start="6417" data-end="6452">Potencia pico y demanda de batería.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6453" data-end="6467">
<p data-start="6455" data-end="6467">SoC min/max.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6468" data-end="6548">
<p data-start="6470" data-end="6548">Tiempo que el sistema mantiene <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7167em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">ω</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2806em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">a</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">r</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">g</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> bajo condiciones realistas.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6549" data-end="6593">
<p data-start="6551" data-end="6593">Estabilidad del PLL (fase <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">ϕ</span></span></span></span> error).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6594" data-end="6636">
<p data-start="6596" data-end="6636">Esfuerzo promedio por bot <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{T_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9701em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8201em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3.2523em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6637" data-end="6697">
<p data-start="6639" data-end="6697">Número de iteraciones/tiempo de control para convergencia.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="6699" data-end="6702">
<h2 data-start="6704" data-end="6761">7) Parámetros sugeridos (valores ejemplo para simular)</h2>
<ul data-start="6762" data-end="7205">
<li data-start="6762" data-end="6824">
<p data-start="6764" data-end="6824"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{noria}=5\cdot10^4\ \mathrm{kg\cdot m^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">I</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0785em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">or</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">ia</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">5</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0085em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">0</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8141em;"><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace">&nbsp;</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm" style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">kg</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">m</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8141em;"><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathrm mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (gran rueda).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6825" data-end="6848">
<p data-start="6827" data-end="6848"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R=15\ \mathrm{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">15</span><span class="mspace">&nbsp;</span><span class="mord mathrm">m</span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6849" data-end="6891">
<p data-start="6851" data-end="6891"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">k</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{bot}=100\ \mathrm{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5806em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">b</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">o</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">100</span><span class="mspace">&nbsp;</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm" style="margin-right: 0.01389em;">kg</span></span></span></span></span> (cada bot).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6892" data-end="6941">
<p data-start="6894" data-end="6941"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">N</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=1000\ \mathrm{N\,m\,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">b</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">1000</span><span class="mspace">&nbsp;</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">N</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathrm">m</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathrm">s</span></span></span></span></span> (rozamiento visc).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6942" data-end="6983">
<p data-start="6944" data-end="6983"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">N</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">/</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">/</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">s</mi><msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_d = 500\ \mathrm{N\,m/(rad/s)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5806em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">c</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">d</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0641em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">500</span><span class="mspace">&nbsp;</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">N</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathrm">m/</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathrm">rad/s</span><span class="mclose"><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8141em;"><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathrm mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6984" data-end="7027">
