<p data-start="477" data-end="565">Esa igualdad aparece <strong data-start="498" data-end="510">tal cual</strong> en el documento: <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="relative inline-flex items-center"><button class="ms-1 flex h-[25px] text-[10px] leading-[13px] rounded-xl corner-superellipse/1.1 items-center justify-center gap-1 px-2 relative text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11.2598 2.25191C11.8396 2.25191 12.2381 2.24808 12.6201 2.33981L12.8594 2.40719C13.0957 2.48399 13.3228 2.5886 13.5352 2.71871L13.6582 2.79879C13.9416 2.99641 14.1998 3.25938 14.5586 3.61813L15.5488 4.60836L15.833 4.89449C16.0955 5.16136 16.2943 5.38072 16.4482 5.6318L16.5703 5.84957C16.6829 6.07074 16.7691 6.30495 16.8271 6.54684L16.8574 6.69137C16.918 7.0314 16.915 7.39998 16.915 7.90719V13.0839C16.915 13.7728 16.9157 14.3301 16.8789 14.7802C16.8461 15.1808 16.781 15.5417 16.6367 15.8779L16.5703 16.0205C16.3049 16.5413 15.9008 16.9772 15.4053 17.2812L15.1865 17.4033C14.8099 17.5951 14.4041 17.6745 13.9463 17.7119C13.4961 17.7487 12.9391 17.749 12.25 17.749H7.75C7.06092 17.749 6.50395 17.7487 6.05371 17.7119C5.65317 17.6791 5.29227 17.6148 4.95606 17.4707L4.81348 17.4033C4.29235 17.1378 3.85586 16.7341 3.55176 16.2382L3.42969 16.0205C3.23787 15.6439 3.15854 15.2379 3.12109 14.7802C3.08432 14.3301 3.08496 13.7728 3.08496 13.0839V6.91695C3.08496 6.228 3.08433 5.67086 3.12109 5.22066C3.1585 4.76296 3.23797 4.35698 3.42969 3.98043C3.73311 3.38494 4.218 2.90008 4.81348 2.59664C5.19009 2.40484 5.59593 2.32546 6.05371 2.28805C6.50395 2.25126 7.06091 2.25191 7.75 2.25191H11.2598ZM7.75 3.58199C7.03896 3.58199 6.54563 3.58288 6.16211 3.61422C5.78642 3.64492 5.575 3.70168 5.41699 3.78219C5.0718 3.95811 4.79114 4.23874 4.61524 4.58395C4.53479 4.74193 4.47795 4.95354 4.44727 5.32906C4.41595 5.71254 4.41504 6.20609 4.41504 6.91695V13.0839C4.41504 13.7947 4.41594 14.2884 4.44727 14.6718C4.47798 15.0472 4.53477 15.259 4.61524 15.417L4.68555 15.5429C4.86186 15.8304 5.11487 16.0648 5.41699 16.2187L5.54688 16.2744C5.69065 16.3258 5.88016 16.3636 6.16211 16.3867C6.54563 16.418 7.03898 16.4189 7.75 16.4189H12.25C12.961 16.4189 13.4544 16.418 13.8379 16.3867C14.2135 16.356 14.425 16.2992 14.583 16.2187L14.709 16.1474C14.9963 15.9712 15.2308 15.7189 15.3848 15.417L15.4414 15.2861C15.4927 15.1425 15.5297 14.953 15.5527 14.6718C15.5841 14.2884 15.585 13.7947 15.585 13.0839V8.55758L13.3506 8.30953C12.2572 8.18804 11.3976 7.31827 11.2881 6.22359L11.0234 3.58199H7.75ZM12.6113 6.09176C12.6584 6.56193 13.0275 6.93498 13.4971 6.98727L15.5762 7.21871C15.5727 7.13752 15.5686 7.07109 15.5615 7.01266L15.5342 6.85738C15.5005 6.7171 15.4501 6.58135 15.3848 6.45309L15.3145 6.32711C15.2625 6.24233 15.1995 6.16135 15.0928 6.04488L14.6084 5.54879L13.6182 4.55856C13.2769 4.21733 13.1049 4.04904 12.9688 3.94234L12.8398 3.8525C12.7167 3.77705 12.5853 3.71637 12.4482 3.67184L12.3672 3.6484L12.6113 6.09176Z"></path></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">4aXm0d0.0,0,, (2)</p></button></span></span></p>
<p data-start="567" data-end="580">Así que sí:</p>
<h3 data-start="581" data-end="599"><strong data-start="585" data-end="597">U₂ = Lsg</strong></h3>
<p data-start="600" data-end="743">En tu modelo U₂ <em data-start="616" data-end="620">no</em> es “enteros no compuestos”, sino <strong data-start="654" data-end="706">exactamente el conjunto de primos Sophie Germain</strong> que sobreviven a las cribas L3 y L4.</p>
<p data-start="745" data-end="931">Yo había interpretado U₂ como “universo reservado tras excluir L3 y L4”, porque esa es la construcción estándar en cribas,<br data-start="867" data-end="870">
pero <strong data-start="875" data-end="931">tu definición explícita en el documento es distinta.</strong></p>
<p data-start="933" data-end="971">Vamos a corregirlo y reordenarlo bien.</p>
<hr data-start="973" data-end="976">
<h1 data-start="978" data-end="1003">✔ TU DEFINICIÓN REAL:</h1>
<h2 data-start="1004" data-end="1055"><strong data-start="1007" data-end="1055">U₂ = Lsg = conjunto de primos Sophie Germain</strong></h2>
<p data-start="1057" data-end="1084">Tu construcción modular es:</p>
<h3 data-start="1086" data-end="1098"><strong data-start="1090" data-end="1096">L1</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1099" data-end="1136">Candidatos a primos Sophie Germain:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p = 6k-1,\quad 2p+1=6h+1.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7778em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8389em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7778em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal">h</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1.</span></span></span></span></span>
<h3 data-start="1170" data-end="1182"><strong data-start="1174" data-end="1180">L3</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1183" data-end="1207">Compuestos para <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span></span></span></span>:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=(6j-1)(6l+1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05724em;">j</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.01968em;">l</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<h3 data-start="1231" data-end="1243"><strong data-start="1235" data-end="1241">L4</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1244" data-end="1271">Compuestos para <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2p+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8389em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span>:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2p+1 = (6s-1)(6d+1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8389em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal">s</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">6</span><span class="mord mathnormal">d</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<h3 data-start="1300" data-end="1322"><strong data-start="1304" data-end="1320">L2 = L3 ∩ L4</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1323" data-end="1368">Los p para los cuales <em data-start="1345" data-end="1352">ambos</em> son compuestos.</p>
<h3 data-start="1370" data-end="1419"><strong data-start="1374" data-end="1417">Entonces la identidad del documento es:</strong></h3>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∪</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∪</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>L</mi><mn>4.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L1 = Lsg \;\cup\; L3 \;\cup\; L4.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord mathnormal">s</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">g</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∪</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∪</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord">4.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="1461" data-end="1505">Y la relación cardinalicia que tú usas es:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>∪</mo><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">/</mi><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant="normal">∣</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|L1| - |L3\cup L4| \;=\; |Lsg| - |L3/L4|.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">∣</span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord">1∣</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">∣</span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∪</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord">4∣</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">∣</span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord mathnormal">s</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">g</span><span class="mord">∣</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">∣</span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord">3/</span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mord">4∣.</span></span></span></span></span>
<hr data-start="1555" data-end="1558">
<h1 data-start="1560" data-end="1588">✔ ¿QUÉ INTENTAS DEMOSTRAR?</h1>
<p data-start="1589" data-end="1702">Que <strong data-start="1593" data-end="1616">Lsg crece sin parar</strong>, porque L1 crece y las cribas L3, L4 no son suficientes para cancelar su crecimiento.</p>
<p data-start="1704" data-end="1744">En tu documento escribes literalmente:</p>
<blockquote data-start="1746" data-end="1886">
<p data-start="1748" data-end="1886">“L1 crece 1/6 de los positivos y la talla de Lsg se relaciona con la de L1 que tiende a infinito.”<br data-start="1846" data-end="1849">
