</li>
<li data-start="9027" data-end="9219">
<p data-start="9029" data-end="9219">Demostración de que <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">U</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.109em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (como conjunto de enteros) es infinito — tu documento ya trae la demostración por CRT/Dirichlet. <strong data-start="9154" data-end="9218">(OJO: esto no demuestra infinitud de primos Sophie Germain).</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="9221" data-end="9275"><strong data-start="9221" data-end="9275">Heurístico / necesita formalizar para ser teorema:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="9276" data-end="9514">
<li data-start="9276" data-end="9514">
<p data-start="9278" data-end="9514">Criterio <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L(n)-m(n)\ge2\Rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≥</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">⇒</span></span></span></span> ≥2 primos — es un <strong data-start="9334" data-end="9356">criterio operativo</strong> y se puede elevar a lema con hipótesis precisas (control de correlaciones, acotaciones de error de inclusión-exclusión). Tus anexos numéricos lo documentan.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="9516" data-end="9548"><strong data-start="9516" data-end="9548">Conjeturas (no demostradas):</strong></p>
<ul data-start="9549" data-end="9847">
<li data-start="9549" data-end="9672">
<p data-start="9551" data-end="9672">“SaltoMáximo ≲ √n” y la versión fuerte de Andrica como teorema. (Conjetura abierta, evidencia numérica en tus tablas).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="9673" data-end="9847">
<p data-start="9675" data-end="9847">Infinitud de primos Sophie Germain (aunque U₂ infinito como enteros está probado, la infinitud de primos SG sigue siendo conjetura). <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="relative inline-flex items-center"><button class="ms-1 flex h-[25px] text-[10px] leading-[13px] rounded-xl corner-superellipse/1.1 items-center justify-center gap-1 px-2 relative text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11.2598 2.25191C11.8396 2.25191 12.2381 2.24808 12.6201 2.33981L12.8594 2.40719C13.0957 2.48399 13.3228 2.5886 13.5352 2.71871L13.6582 2.79879C13.9416 2.99641 14.1998 3.25938 14.5586 3.61813L15.5488 4.60836L15.833 4.89449C16.0955 5.16136 16.2943 5.38072 16.4482 5.6318L16.5703 5.84957C16.6829 6.07074 16.7691 6.30495 16.8271 6.54684L16.8574 6.69137C16.918 7.0314 16.915 7.39998 16.915 7.90719V13.0839C16.915 13.7728 16.9157 14.3301 16.8789 14.7802C16.8461 15.1808 16.781 15.5417 16.6367 15.8779L16.5703 16.0205C16.3049 16.5413 15.9008 16.9772 15.4053 17.2812L15.1865 17.4033C14.8099 17.5951 14.4041 17.6745 13.9463 17.7119C13.4961 17.7487 12.9391 17.749 12.25 17.749H7.75C7.06092 17.749 6.50395 17.7487 6.05371 17.7119C5.65317 17.6791 5.29227 17.6148 4.95606 17.4707L4.81348 17.4033C4.29235 17.1378 3.85586 16.7341 3.55176 16.2382L3.42969 16.0205C3.23787 15.6439 3.15854 15.2379 3.12109 14.7802C3.08432 14.3301 3.08496 13.7728 3.08496 13.0839V6.91695C3.08496 6.228 3.08433 5.67086 3.12109 5.22066C3.1585 4.76296 3.23797 4.35698 3.42969 3.98043C3.73311 3.38494 4.218 2.90008 4.81348 2.59664C5.19009 2.40484 5.59593 2.32546 6.05371 2.28805C6.50395 2.25126 7.06091 2.25191 7.75 2.25191H11.2598ZM7.7