</span></span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1929" data-end="1973">Va bien si <strong data-start="1940" data-end="1972">eliges k para forzar paridad</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="1975" data-end="1992">Paridad objetivo:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence="true">(</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>impar</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>impar</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>impar</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo fence="true">)</mo></mrow><mo>≡</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mspace width="0.3333em"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(\frac{n}{2}\cdot \text{impar} + (\text{impar}-2) + \text{impar}\cdot k\right) \equiv 0 \pmod 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.836em; vertical-align: -0.686em;"></span><span class="minner"><span class="mopen delimcenter" style="top: 0em;"><span class="delimsizing size2">(</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.1076em;"><span style="top: -2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">2</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">impar</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">impar</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">impar</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mclose delimcenter" style="top: 0em;"><span class="delimsizing size2">)</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≡</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mspace allowbreak"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">mod</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.3333em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2102" data-end="2127">Simplificando (impar ≡1):</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mtext>impar</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mspace width="0.3333em"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{n}{2} + \text{impar}-2 + k \equiv 0 \pmod 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.7936em; vertical-align: -0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.1076em;"><span style="top: -2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">2</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8623em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">impar</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7278em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≡</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mspace allowbreak"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">mod</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.3333em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mspace width="0.3333em"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{n}{2} -1 + k \equiv 0 \pmod 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.7936em; vertical-align: -0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.1076em;"><span style="top: -2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">2</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7278em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≡</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mspace allowbreak"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">mod</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.3333em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2228" data-end="2305">⇒ <strong data-start="2230" data-end="2255">k ≡ 1 - n/2   (mod 2)</strong><br data-start="2255" data-end="2258">
Solo necesitas ajustar k = 0 o 1 según el caso.</p>
<p data-start="2307" data-end="2380"><strong data-start="2307" data-end="2380">O sea: el error no es la idea, es que te falta la corrección modular.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="2382" data-end="2385">
<h1 data-start="2387" data-end="2436">📌 4. ¿Qué significa esto para tu “Collatz+”?</h1>
<p data-start="2437" data-end="2574">Que <strong data-start="2441" data-end="2454">sí puedes</strong> crear una función anidada “Collatz-like” con impar fijo,<br data-start="2511" data-end="2514">
pero <strong data-start="2519" data-end="2573">solo si la ecuación fuerza enteridad en cada nivel</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="2576" data-end="2594">En otras palabras:</p>
<h3 data-start="2596" data-end="2627">✔ Tu sistema NO está roto</h3>
<h3 data-start="2628" data-end="2672">✘ Solo le falta la congruencia de cierre</h3>
<p data-start="2674" data-end="2693">Te lo pongo bonito:</p>
<hr data-start="2695" data-end="2698">
<h1 data-start="2700" data-end="2750">🧠 <strong data-start="2705" data-end="2750">COLLATZ+ CORREGIDO (versión tuya, formal)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="2752" data-end="2780">Dado un impar <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span></span></span></span>, define:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T(n)=\frac{n\cdot m + (m-2) + m\cdot k(n)}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 2.113em; vertical-align: -0.686em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.427em;"><span style="top: -2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">2</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">m</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">⋅</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.686em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose nulldelimiter"></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2835" data-end="2840">donde</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mspace></mspace><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">m</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">o</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi></mrow><mspace width="0.3333em"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k(n) \equiv 1 - n \pmod 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≡</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7278em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mspace allowbreak"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathrm">mod</span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.3333em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="2875" data-end="2973">Esto garantiza que <strong data-start="2894" data-end="2920">T(n) siempre es entero</strong>,<br data-start="2921" data-end="2924">
y puedes anidar T(T(T(...(n)))) sin que se rompa.</p>
<hr data-start="2975" data-end="2978">
<h1 data-start="2980" data-end="3071">📌 5. ¿Quieres que lo convierta en un teorema, pseudocódigo, criba o análisis dinámico?</h1>
<p data-start="3072" data-end="3077">Dime:</p>
<ul data-start="3079" data-end="3268">
<li data-start="3079" data-end="3119">
<p data-start="3081" data-end="3119"><strong data-start="3081" data-end="3087">A)</strong> Teorema formal y demostración</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3120" data-end="3165">
<p data-start="3122" data-end="3165"><strong data-start="3122" data-end="3128">B)</strong> Pseudocódigo optimizado “Collatz+”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3166" data-end="3214">
<p data-start="3168" data-end="3214"><strong data-start="3168" data-end="3174">C)</strong> Demostración de convergencia o ciclos</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3215" data-end="3268">
<p data-start="3217" data-end="3268"><strong data-start="3217" data-end="3223">D)</strong> Versión para tus libros con estilo Machine</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3270" data-end="3280" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Tú eliges.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-(--header-height)" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-turn-id="bbb21898-a76e-49d5-a5f0-4c4883863034" data-testid="conversation-turn-153" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="user"><h5 class="sr-only">Dijiste:</h5><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden mb-10 relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="bbb21898-a76e-49d5-a5f0-4c4883863034" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/1.1 relative rounded-[18px] px-4 py-1.5 data-[multiline]:py-3 max-w-[var(--user-chat-width,70%)]" data-multiline=""><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap">No como no fuerza ser entero converge a una potencia de 2 collaz </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(-