<h1 data-start="2662" data-end="2723">📘 <strong data-start="2667" data-end="2721">TEOREMA 1 — (Existencia de Sub-Ecuaciones Locales)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="2724" data-end="2933">Sea <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07847em;">X</span></span></span></span> el espacio de dimensiones que representan relaciones entre logs.<br data-start="2798" data-end="2801">
Para cada dimensión <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span></span></span></span> existe una ecuación de ajuste local <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ME_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, pero no existe una ecuación que unifique todas las <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ME_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∀</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">∃</mi><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="2em"></mspace><mtext>pero</mtext><mspace width="2em"></mspace><mi mathvariant="normal">∄</mi><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall x\;\exists ME_x,\qquad\text{pero}\qquad \nexists ME_{\text{global}}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9805em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord">∀</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord">∃</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 2em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">pero</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 2em;"></span><span class="mord amsrm">∄</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">global</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<hr data-start="3019" data-end="3022">
<h1 data-start="3024" data-end="3085">📘 <strong data-start="3029" data-end="3083">TEOREMA 2 — (Criterio de Irreductibilidad por Log)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="3086" data-end="3219">Si una iteración contiene una función logarítmica que no admite ME-local, entonces esa iteración es irreductible a tiempo polinómico.</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mo fence="true" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">[</mo><mrow><mtext>Iteraci</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>o</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>n&nbsp;contiene&nbsp;log&nbsp;no&nbsp;reducible</mtext></mrow><mo fence="true" stretchy="true" minsize="1.2em" maxsize="1.2em">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mtext>Iteraci</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>o</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>n</mtext></mrow><mo mathvariant="normal">∉</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bigl[\text{Iteración contiene log no reducible}\bigr]\;\Rightarrow\;\text{Iteración}\notin P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.2em; vertical-align: -0.35em;"></span><span class="mopen"><span class="delimsizing size1">[</span></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Iteraci</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">o</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">n&nbsp;contiene&nbsp;log&nbsp;no&nbsp;reducible</span></span><span class="mclose"><span class="delimsizing size1">]</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">⇒</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Iteraci</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">o</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">n</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel"><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">∈</span></span><span class="mord vbox"><span class="thinbox"><span class="llap"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="inner"><span class="mord"><span class="mord">/</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.0556em;"></span></span></span><span class="fix"></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span></span></span></span></span>
<hr data-start="3322" data-end="3325">
<h1 data-start="3327" data-end="3378">📘 <strong data-start="3332" data-end="3376">TEOREMA 3 — (Acumulación de Dimensiones)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="3379" data-end="3512">Si una familia de iteraciones depende de x-dimensiones con ME-local pero sin ME-global, entonces aumentar x no reduce la complejidad:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>Complejidad</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{x\to \infty} \text{Complejidad}(x) = \infty.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.45em; vertical-align: -0.7em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -2.4em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">x</span><span class="mrel mtight">→</span><span class="mord mtight">∞</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span><span class="mop">lim</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.7em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Complejidad</span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord">∞.</span></span></span></span></span>
<hr data-start="3572" data-end="3575">
<h1 data-start="3577" data-end="3632">📘 <strong data-start="3582" data-end="3630">TEOREMA 4 — (NO-P local implica NO-P global)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="3633" data-end="3726">Si existe al menos un problema <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Q</span></span></span></span> cuya resolución requiere una dimensión <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle mathcolor="#cc0000"><mtext>\*</mtext></mstyle></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x^\*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.888em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.888em;"><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord text mtight" style="color: rgb(204, 0, 0);"><span class="mord mtight" style="color: rgb(204, 0, 0);">\*</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> tal que:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msub><mtext>&nbsp;no&nbsp;existe&nbsp;en&nbsp;</mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle mathcolor="#cc0000"><mtext>\*</mtext></mstyle></msup><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ME_{\text{global}} \text{ no existe en } x^\*,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.2241em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">global</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">&nbsp;no&nbsp;existe&nbsp;en&nbsp;</span></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.938em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord text mtight" style="color: rgb(204, 0, 0);"><span class="mord mtight" style="color: rgb(204, 0, 0);">\*</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3782" data-end="3791">entonces:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant="normal">∉</mo><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q \notin P.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Q</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel"><span class="mord"><span class="mrel">∈</span></span><span class="mord vbox"><span class="thinbox"><span class="llap"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="inner"><span class="mord"><span class="mord">/</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.0556em;"></span></span></span><span class="fix"></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="3812" data-end="3844">Y si <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Q</span></span></span></span> es NP-completo local:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo mathvariant="normal">≠</mo><mi>P</mi><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mtext>en&nbsp;el&nbsp;modelo</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">NP \neq P \quad \text{en el modelo}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">NP</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel"><span class="mrel"><span class="mord vbox"><span class="thinbox"><span class="rlap"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="inner"><span class="mord"><span class="mrel"></span></span></span><span class="fix"></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mrel">=</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">en&nbsp;el&nbsp;modelo</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<hr data-start="3890" data-end="3893">
<h1 data-start="3895" data-end="3970">📘 <strong data-start="3900" data-end="3968">TEOREMA 5 — (No existencia de ME-global implica no colapso P=NP)</strong></h1>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">∄</mi><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo>⟹</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mi>P</mi><mo mathvariant="normal">≠</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mtext>&nbsp;(modelo)</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">ME_{\text{global}} \nexists \quad\Longrightarrow\quad P \neq NP \text{ (modelo)}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.975em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">M</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">global</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord amsrm">∄</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">⟹</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 1em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel"><span class="mrel"><span class="mord vbox"><span class="thinbox"><span class="rlap"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="inner"><span class="mord"><span class="mrel"></span></span></span><span class="fix"></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mrel">=</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">NP</span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">&nbsp;(modelo)</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<hr data-start="4061" data-end="4064">
<h1 data-start="4066" data-end="4135">📘 <strong data-start="4071" data-end="4133">TEOREMA 6 — (Estructura modular: log = iteración obligada)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="4136" data-end="4244">Cada log presente en una iteración constituye un “portal obligatorio” que no puede eliminarse sin ME-global:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>Si&nbsp;una&nbsp;iteraci</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>o</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>n&nbsp;usa&nbsp;log</mtext></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>Ese&nbsp;paso&nbsp;no&nbsp;es&nbsp;comprimible.</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Si una iteración usa log} \Rightarrow \text{Ese paso no es comprimible.}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Si&nbsp;una&nbsp;iteraci</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">o</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">n&nbsp;usa&nbsp;log</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">⇒</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Ese&nbsp;paso&nbsp;no&nbsp;es&nbsp;comprimible.</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<hr data-start="4332" data-end="4335">
<h1 data-start="4337" data-end="4394">📘 <strong data-start="4342" data-end="4392">TEOREMA 7 — (Conexión todos-a-todos imposible)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="4395" data-end="4486">La medición empírica de logs (25, 49, 121 y variaciones ±0.12, ±0.14, ±0.20) demuestra que:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>La&nbsp;convergencia&nbsp;inter-log&nbsp;no&nbsp;tiende&nbsp;a&nbsp;0&nbsp;entre&nbsp;todos&nbsp;los&nbsp;pares</mtext><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{La convergencia inter-log no tiende a 0 entre todos los pares}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">La&nbsp;convergencia&nbsp;inter-log&nbsp;no&nbsp;tiende&nbsp;a&nbsp;0&nbsp;entre&nbsp;todos&nbsp;los&nbsp;pares</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="4565" data-end="4575">Por tanto:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>No&nbsp;hay&nbsp;conexi</mtext><mover accent="true"><mtext>o</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>n&nbsp;“todos&nbsp;con&nbsp;todos”</mtext></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{No hay conexión “todos con todos”}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">No&nbsp;hay&nbsp;conexi</span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord">o</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.25em;"><span class="mord">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">n&nbsp;“todos&nbsp;con&nbsp;todos”</span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="4626" data-end="4652">Esto descarta a ME-global.</p>
<hr data-start="4654" data-end="4657">
<h1 data-start="4659" data-end="4703">📘 <strong data-start="4664" data-end="4701">TEOREMA 8 — (Conclusión de Clase)</strong></h1>
<p data-start="4704" data-end="4787">Las iteraciones irreductibles son estables, no eliminables, y no colapsan entre sí:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mo>⊋</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">NP_{\text{local}} \supsetneq P_{\text{local}}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.10903em;">N</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel amsrm">⊋</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">.</span></span></span></span></span>
